return {h=8,w=245,cr=45,hc=35,bh=70,gr="medium",eg={"ground"},st={65,65,60,110,95,130},ab={{10,0},{95,1}},genus={en="Lightning Pokémon",es="Pokémon Relámpago",pt="Pokémon Relâmpago"},flavor={en={[1]="It accumulates negative ions in the atmosphere to blast out 10000-volt lightning bolts.",[2]="It accumulates negative ions in the atmosphere to blast out 10000-volt lightning bolts.",[3]="A sensitive Pokémon that easily becomes sad or angry. Every time its mood changes, it charges power.",[4]="It concentrates the weak electric charges emitted by its cells and launches wicked lightning bolts.",[5]="Every hair on its body starts to stand sharply on end if it becomes charged with electricity.",[6]="The negatively charged ions generated in its fur create a constant sparking noise.",[7]="JOLTEON’s cells generate a low level of electricity. This power is amplified by the static electricity of its fur, enabling the Pokémon to drop thunderbolts. The bristling fur is made of electrically charged needles.",[8]="JOLTEON’s cells generate a low level of electricity. This power is amplified by the static electricity of its fur, enabling the Pokémon to drop thunderbolts. The bristling fur is made of electrically charged needles.",[9]="Its cells generate weak power that is amplified by its fur’s static electricity to drop thunderbolts. The bristling fur is made of electrically charged needles.",[10]="If it is angered or startled, the fur all over its body bristles like sharp needles that pierce foes.",[11]="It accumulates negative ions in the atmosphere to blast out 10,000-volt lightning bolts.",[12]="It controls 10,000-volt power and can raise all the fur on its body as if it were sharp needles.",[13]="It controls 10,000-volt power and can raise all the fur on its body as if it were sharp needles.",[14]="If agitated, it uses electricity to straighten out its fur and launch it in small bunches.",[15]="It concentrates the weak electric charges emitted by its cells and launches wicked lightning bolts.",[16]="Every hair on its body starts to stand sharply on end if it becomes charged with electricity.",[17]="If agitated, it uses electricity to straighten out its fur and launch it in small bunches.",[18]="If agitated, it uses electricity to straighten out its fur and launch it in small bunches.",[21]="By storing electricity in its body, it can shoot its bristlelike fur like a barrage of missiles.",[22]="By storing electricity in its body, it can shoot its bristlelike fur like a barrage of missiles.",[23]="Every hair on its body starts to stand sharply on end if it becomes charged with electricity.",[24]="It accumulates negative ions in the atmosphere to blast out 10,000-volt lightning bolts.",[25]="Jolteon’s cells generate a low level of electricity. This power is amplified by the static electricity of its fur, enabling the Pokémon to drop thunderbolts. The bristling fur is made of electrically charged needles.",[26]="Jolteon’s cells generate a low level of electricity. This power is amplified by the static electricity of its fur, enabling the Pokémon to drop thunderbolts. The bristling fur is made of electrically charged needles.",[27]="They send out electrical charges of about 10,000 volts. Because they are high-strung, it can be difficult to grow close to them.",[28]="When its fur stands on end, that’s a sign it’s about to give off a jolt of electricity. Take care, as sometimes lightning strikes next to it, too.",[29]="Its lungs contain an organ that creates electricity. The crackling sound of electricity can be heard when it exhales.",[30]="Its fur stands on end, becoming like needles it fires at enemies. Once they’re weakened, it finishes them off with a 10,000 volt shock.",[31]="A sensitive Pokémon that easily becomes sad or angry. Every time its mood changes, it charges power.",[32]="A sensitive Pokémon that easily becomes sad or angry. Every time its mood changes, it charges power.",[33]="If it is angered or startled, the fur all over its body bristles like sharp needles that pierce foes.",[34]="It accumulates negative ions in the atmosphere to blast out 10,000-volt lightning bolts.",[39]="Bristles its fur into sharp, needlelike points when enraged. One can hear electricity crackle in its breath when it exhales."},es={[23]="Todos los pelos de su cuerpo se ponen de punta si empieza a cargarse de electricidad.",[24]="Acumula iones negativos de la atmósfera para lanzar rayos de 10 000 voltios de potencia.",[25]="Las células de Jolteon generan un nivel bajo de electricidad, cuya intensidad aumenta con la electricidad estática que acumula en un pelaje formado por agujas cargadas de electricidad. Esta característica le permite lanzar rayos.",[26]="Las células de Jolteon generan un nivel bajo de electricidad, cuya intensidad aumenta con la electricidad estática que acumula en un pelaje formado por agujas cargadas de electricidad. Esta característica le permite lanzar rayos.",[27]="Lanza rayos de 10 000 voltios de potencia. Es difícil congeniar con este Pokémon debido a su naturaleza nerviosa.",[28]="Cuando su pelaje se pone de punta, es señal de que va a soltar una descarga. Hay que tener cuidado porque pueden caer rayos cerca.",[29]="Posee un órgano en los pulmones que genera electricidad. Cuando respira se puede oír un crepitar eléctrico.",[30]="Lanza sus pelos erizados a modo de púas. Tras debilitar a su rival, lo remata con una descarga de 10 000 voltios.",[31]="Un Pokémon muy sensible que se entristece o enfada con mucha facilidad. Se carga de electricidad cada vez que cambia de humor.",[32]="Un Pokémon muy sensible que se entristece o enfada con mucha facilidad. Se carga de electricidad cada vez que cambia de humor.",[33]="Si se enfada o asusta, se le eriza el pelaje. Cada uno de sus pelos se convierte en una afilada púa que hace trizas al rival.",[34]="Acumula iones negativos de la atmósfera para lanzar rayos de 10 000 V de potencia."},pt="Quando fica furioso, arrepia o pelo em pontas afiadas como agulh